      "description": "The comment says a failed gh lookup \"keeps the worktree like an unshipped one\". That holds only under `--merged` (line 74). With named args an unshipped worktree is still removed at line 79. A failed lookup then only sets `SHIPPED=0`, so what is kept is the branch, and only when origin doesn't already hold its commits.",
