      "tag": "nit",
      "description": "The \"(no auth, no network)\" example is partly misleading. A network failure usually makes the fetch at line 30 fail first, which sets `FETCHED=0` and skips `shipped` entirely, so gh's error is never shown for that case. Dropping \"no network\" would fix it.",
